<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 JO TECALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jo Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tec</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO TECALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Anyobanyoba ma ocake i lok ma mako dwogo pa Kricito i lobo okelo ayela madit i kanica ma i Tecalonika. Dong waraga me Aryo Ma Paulo ocoyo bot jo Tecalonika mako kom lok malube ki lok man ni: nino dwogo pa Rwot dong oromo woko. Paulo ocoyo waraga man me tiro lok man, kun tito kore ki kore kit ma Kricito bidwogo kwede, kun nyutu ni, bal ki tim aranyi kong bibedo ka time i yo ma lamal ite loc pa ngat mukane ma kilwongo ni “Latim bal” 2:3, kun bene nongo telo wi lujemo ikom Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo bene nwoyo tito matek ni dano omyero gubed ma gutegi i niyegi kadi bed ayelayela ki can bibino ikwogi, dok bene ni gumede ki tic pien kwo myero omede anyim kit macalo Paulo ki luwote bene gitiyo ki cinggi, kun bene gimede ki tic mabeco i yo ducu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pak ki pwoc <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok mamako dwogo pa Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma Lukricitayo kwo kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol lok <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Tic 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ki Silvano ka Temceo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Bot lwak jo ma oye Kricito ma gibedo i Tecalonika ma gitye i Lubanga Won ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito: <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Lubanga Won ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omii botwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikare me dwogo pa Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Utmegiwa, wan myero wapwo Lubanga jwijwi pirwu. Omyero wapwoye pien niyewu tye ka dongo matek tutwal, ki mar ma dano acel acel maro ki lawote bene tye ka mede. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Pimeno wan bene wanyate pirwu ikin jo ma oye Lubanga ikabedo ducu, pi diyo cwinywu ki pi niyewu i aunauna ma giunuwu kwede ki ican ducu ma wutye ka cirone. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Meno aye lanen ma nyutu kit ma Lubanga ngolo kwede kop atir dok kakare, wek kibikwanwu ni wun jo ma myero i ker pa Lubanga ma wutye kaneno can pireni. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Lubangawa bitimo gin ma atir: en biketo can ikom jo ma guketo can ikomwu, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />ka dong miyowu yweyo, wun jo ma kiketo can ikomwu, kacel ki wan bene. Meno en bitimo ikare ma Rwot Yecu binen iye ma kun a ki i polo kacel ki lumalaikane matek <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />i dye mac ma lyel, ikare ma en biculu kwor ikom jo ma pe ngeyo Lubanga, ki ikom jo ma pe gilubu lok me Kwena Maber ikom Rwotwa Yecu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Ica 2:10</ref></char></note> Kop ma kibingolo ikomgi en aye can me to ma pe gik, kun kiryemogi woko ki inyim Rwot dok ki inyim deyo me tekone. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Inino meno, ikare ma en bidwogo kun deyone binene i jone maleng, ma nongo giure ikin jo ducu muye en; pien yam dong wuye lok me caden ma watito botwu.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo walego Lubanga pirwu nino ducu, wek en omii wubed jo ma myero ma kwowu rwate ki lwongo ma en olwongowu kwede, wek Lubanga okonywu ki tekone me cobo mitiwu ducu mabeco ki tic ducu ma wutiyo pi niye. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Meno bimiyo dano keto deyo inying Rwotwa Yecu Kricito pirwu, dok wun bene wubinongo deyo pire, pi kica pa Lubangawa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Latim bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Tec 4:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Utmegiwa, lok ikom dwogo pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki cokewa me rwate kwede, wabako dogwa botwu ni, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />pe wuwek tamwu oryange oyotoyot, cwinywu bene myero pe opoti, kadi pi lok ma wuwinyo ki bot lanebi mo nyo pi lok ma kitito, nyo kadi pi waraga mo ma kiwaco ni oa ki botwa, ma tito ni, nino pa Rwot dong oo. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Pe wuwek ngat mo obwolwu i yo ducu, pien nino meno pud pe bibino, nio wang ma jemo ikom Lubanga kong obedo tye, dok bene nio wang ma latim bal onen, ma en aye ngat ma agikine tye imac me geena. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Eje 28:2</ref></char></note> En pyem, dok kete kene me bedo malo maloyo gin ducu ma kilwongo ni lubanga, nyo gin mo ma giworo; dok bibedo iwi kome i ot pa Lubanga, kun nyute kene ni en Lubanga. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Pe wupo ni yam atitiwu lok man ikare ma pud atye botwu? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Wungeyo bene gin matye ka genge i kareni, wek onen ka dong kare oromo. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Pien twero mukane pa latim bal kombedi dong tye katic; ento gin ma myero otime pe bitime nio ka ngat ma genge dong kikwanye woko. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Ica 11:4</ref></char></note> Lacene dano man ma en latim bal binen, ci ka Rwot Yecu bituc ci bityeke woko ki deyo me dwogone. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref></char></note> Latim bal man bibino ki teko pa Catan ki lanyut mogo ki tango mogo me goba, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />dok bibedo ki lwak bwola maracu pi jo ma birwenyo matwal, pien gukwero maro lok me ada matwero larogi. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Pimeno Lubanga biketogi ite twero me bwola, wek guye goba, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />wek kingol kop oloo jo ma pe ye lok me ada, ento cwinygi yom i timo gin ma pe tye atir.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma Lubanga oyero pi lare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Utmegiwa ma Rwot maro, myero wapwo Lubanga pirwu nino ducu, pien Lubanga okwongo yerowu con wek elarwu pi Cwiny Maleng ma lonyowu wubedo maleng, ki pi ye lok me ada. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Lubanga olwongowu i man ki lok me Kwena Maber ma watito, wek wunong deyo pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Pimeno utmegiwa, wucung matek, wumak kit pwony ma wapwonyowu kwede, i lok nyo ki i coc ma wacoyo i waraga.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Kombeddi dong alego Rwot Yecu kikome, ki Lubanga Wonwa ma omarowa dok okweyo cwinywa matwal ki gen maber ma obino pi kica, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />wek okwe cwinywu, omokwu matek i tic ki i lok ducu mabeco.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Wuleg pirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Me agikine, utmegiwa, wuleg Lubanga pirwa, wek lok pa Rwot owinye kun ywek woko oyotoyot, wek dano guket iye deyo kit macalo bene otime ikinwu, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />dok bene wek walare ki i cing jo maracu, ma kitgi obale woko; pien jo mogo pe gitye ki niye. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Rwot gene, en bimiyowu teko, dok bigwokowu ki ikom gin marac. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Watye ki gen i Rwot ikomwu ni, wutye katiyo gin ma nene wacikowu ni wutii, dok bene wubimede kitiyone. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Rwot myero otel cwinywu nio wa i mar pa Lubanga ki i diyo cwiny ma a ki bot Kricito.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano myero guti tic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Utmegiwa, kombedi wacikowu inying Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ni, wupoke woko ki ikom ominwu mo ma lawackom ma bedo kawire kun balo kare nono labongo tic mo, ma pe lubu kit ma myero ma wun wumako ki botwa. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Wun ki komwu wungeyo kit ma myero wulub kwede kitwa. Ikare ma nene watye botwu pe wabedo luwackom kun wabalo kare nono labongo tic mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Wan yam pe wacamo cam pa ngat mo labongo culune, ento wacane i tic dyeceng ki dyewor wek pe waket peko ikom dano mo ikinwu ki lego kony. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Pe teloke ni wan wapeke ki twero, ento wamine giwa kenwa me bedo lanen ma myero wun wulubi. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Pien kadi ikare ma onongo watye botwu, wamiyowu cik man ni, ngat ma dag tic myero wutwon cam woko. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Pien wawinyo ni jo mogo ikinwu komgi wac, gibedo kawire kun gibalo kare nono ma pe gitiyo tic mo, ento giroyo wigi i tic pa jo mukene. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Waciko kodi dano macalo meno, dok wabako dogwa botgi i Rwot Yecu Kricito ni, myero guti ticgi mot, wek ngat acel acel opite gire kene.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Utmegiwa, pe wuol katiyo gin maber. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ka ngat mo okwero lubu lok ma kicoyo i waraga man, myero wuniang maber ikom dano meno, pe wuribe kwede, wek lewic omake. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Pe wunene macalo lakworwu, ento wucike macalo ominwu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lego gum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Rwot ma en won kuc omiwu kuc ikare ducu, i yo ducu. Rwot obed kwedwu ducu.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />An Paulo acoyo botwu mot man ki cinga. Man aye lanen matye i waragana ducu; man aye kit ma acoyo kwede.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu ducu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>